      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 49
      }
    },
    "text": "The gap between what one desires and one's present state exists due to a lack of right understanding and self-exploration, where effort is often focused solely on physical facilities rather than developing understanding and right feelings in relationships.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 46
      }
    },
    "review_flags": []
  },
  {
    "op_id": "op_0004",
    "task_id": "task_0004",
    "strategy": "insert_below",
    "target": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 46
      }
    },
    "text": "To fill this gap, one needs to engage in continuous self-exploration, develop right understanding through value-based education, and ensure harmony in thoughts, relationships, and nature.",
    "style_clone_from": {
      "adapter": "docx",
      "payload": {
        "v": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "part": "word/document.xml",
        "body_index": 46
      }
    },
    "review_flags": [
