    "text": "Holistic development means the all-around development of a human being encompassing right understanding in the self, fulfillment in human-to-human relationships, and prosperity with physical facilities. Education\u2013sanskar plays the vital role of facilitating right understanding and human conduct, transforming society toward a humane order.",
